al years: latest tax-year records for each PIN in `borappeals_UPDATED.csv`, including all ties. Names come only from BOR records for that PIN, with no fallback to reviewed names. Buyer names come from the assignment file; purchase years are matched by PIN, sale document, and buyer in Assessor_Parcel_Sales_20250105.csv. Unmatched years are shown as unavailable. Last positive bills use the 2006-2024 history, and TIF membership uses tif_record_present in the 2024 extract. Class descriptions: `class_dict_expanded.csv`. Geometry: 2024 footprints from `ptaxsim-2024.0.0.db`.\n\nPIN totals come from the tabular universe, independently of map coverage. Footprints are drawn once even when multiple PINs share the same ten-digit identifier. Assignment-review counts identify flagged records; absence of a flag does not certify an assignment. Directory and PIN-search pages may still use older data vintages.\n",
